ON\nWE TRY OUR BEST TO CHECK FOR DEFECTS OR EXCESSIVE WEAR, BUT THEY ARE MISSED ON OCCASSION. WITH THIS IN MIND, WE ARE SELLING THE ITEM \"AS IS\". ALL SALES ARE FINAL!\n*THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR SHOPPING ON SHOPGOODWILL.COM AND SUPPORTING OUR MISSION TO SUPPORT PERSONS WITH DISABILITIES AND OTHER BARRIERS TO INDEPENDENCE IN ACHIEVING THEIR FULLEST POTENTIAL AS WORKERS AND AS MEMBERS OF THE BROADER COMMUNITY.",
